   * @x-autobe-authorization-type join
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor superAdmin
   * @x-autobe-specification Handle super administrator registration by creating a super admin record with bcrypt hashed password (cost factor 12) and creating an initial email verification token. Process validates email format, uniqueness, and password complexity requirements.
